10                                                                                                  
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
1 / 2                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-9                                                                                              
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -5.0 5.0 0.01                                                                                
.NO4IND                                                                                             
